  Demo recipes (runnable end-to-end): - docs/DEMO-RESEARCH-TEAM.md — 5-agent research
  team (intro demo) - docs/DEMO-MULTI-ARCH-30.md — 30-agent multi-arch team (stress-test
  demo). Drive it via the bundled recipe: recipe/dev-mas-engineer-30agents.yaml'
