  ## STEP 1 — DELEGATE TO DIRECTOR

  Delegate all dev-mas-engineer tasks to sub_mas-dev-director.

  This recipe is a thin delegator only — it does not contain logic directly.

  Load sub_mas-dev-director and execute its instructions.


  ## STEP 2 — COLLECT RESULTS

  Collect results from sub_mas-dev-director and return to caller.

  '
